[[Image:Isk x2inti.gif|right|Intimidate]]
The character can use this skill to get a bully to back down or make a prisoner give him the information he wants.
*'''Ability''': [[charisma]]

*'''Classes''': [[assassin]], [[barbarian]], [[blackguard]], [[purple dragon knight]], [[rogue]], [[weapon master]]

*'''[[Cross-class skill|Cross-class]]''': yes

*'''[[untrained skill check|Requires training]]''': no

*'''Check''': The character can use this skill to change others' behavior with a successful check.

*'''Use''': Selected in dialog

==Notes==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*Not as commonly used as the [[persuade]] skill by module designers.
*The weapon master prestige class requires 4 ranks in intimidate.
*Determines the DC of the [[terrifying rage]] feat.
